1 can chickpeas 6 dates 1/2 cup cocoa powder 1 cup hot water 1/4 cup chocolate chips (optional) 

Roast your chickpeas at 350 for 15 minutes (optional), then blend all your ingredients together until smooth and creamy (add 1 tbsp of water at a time if too thick).  

Enjoy on fruit, bread or on top of yogurt or oatmeal.  